{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/5\u670821\u65e5.gif?t=1747793411\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight monsters in each night, survive as long as you can! Nocturnal Survivors is a single player survivor-like auto-shooter game in which you simply keep combining your weapons to more powerful versions to kill thousands of monsters at nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite map with day-night cycles (currently 1 map with 4 types of monster)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep weapon combination system (currently 20 weapons in Early Access)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bizarre and powerful artifacts (currently 20 artifacts in Early Access)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more in plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLAYTEST UPDATE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtest is open for everyone! I wish you enjoy the game. Feel free to report any bug in the forum and let me know how do you feel about the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtest will be ended around May 28, two days before the launch.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738660?t=1747793411","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738660?t=1747793411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/e8809a470bf4be191bf5525a715d584d5d768a20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747793411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/e8809a470bf4be191bf5525a715d584d5d768a20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747793411","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/extras/5\u670821\u65e5.gif?t=1747793411\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight monsters in each night, survive as long as you can! Nocturnal Survivors is a single player survivor-like auto-shooter game in which you simply keep combining your weapons to more powerful versions to kill thousands of monsters at nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite map with day-night cycles (currently 1 map with 4 types of monster)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep weapon combination system (currently 20 weapons in Early Access)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bizarre and powerful artifacts (currently 20 artifacts in Early Access)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more in plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLAYTEST UPDATE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtest is open for everyone! I wish you enjoy the game. Feel free to report any bug in the forum and let me know how do you feel about the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtest will be ended around May 28, two days before the launch.</p>","developers":["azuresu"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738660/d22d0f8322c91d64fae4012259124b77f0f4efaa/header.jpg?t=1747793411","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>",